                <l xml:id="m-f302107d-d646-43bd-b677-14c0452e138a" facs="#m-584ba512-306b-411a-a3ee-9465500c31ef" label="ambiguous">Christmas Eve.</l><l xml:id="m-5d124b9d-2ec1-4887-ba64-c544ba8aaa17" facs="#m-aa6198a8-0d9e-4d13-b80d-df425d678680" label="ambiguous">359</l><l xml:id="m-8d723ef9-29a8-4c82-aee4-5868d0e9d0a4" facs="#m-23cc7f3b-92ce-4f43-b0d8-ea07294a9171" label="lyrics-like">ma-ne vidébi-tis gló¬ ri-am é-jus.</l><l xml:id="m-a099ae50-7252-43d7-8666-8f89bfed516e" facs="#m-c3c803b3-61ea-4845-9f4c-39e3b230588d" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-70990427-7089-4f6d-a748-93fc93e994f4" facs="#m-7f8d430d-84e7-403b-b840-f7316f3ee7ed" label="text-like">Psalms of the Sunday. p. 236.</l><l xml:id="m-39f35884-c564-4121-a5d6-d5decda65cfc" facs="#m-23a11675-0cbb-4676-9098-e66767664412" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-14458ecf-5ae0-4981-9b8d-7f11a9880de2" facs="#m-0ee2a27c-2c73-4e43-b7f3-f56ed72a965e" label="ambiguous">Rom. T.</l><l xml:id="m-df300cbe-c2b2-409b-9ab0-2b0eaa1fa48a" facs="#m-d1b4688e-60da-4d87-aa1d-d970d39200c1" label="ambiguous">)Aulus, servus Jesu Christi, vo¬</l><l xml:id="m-7a8efcc0-e626-4ccf-95a0-b3f1363b2089" facs="#m-5c86751a-a326-4fcd-97e6-6a59c22d5d1e" label="lyrics-like">ptúris sanctis de Filio suo, *qui</l><l xml:id="m-1ec0157c-c5e0-4521-ad3f-40dd42531911" facs="#m-92d4af75-db58-4940-8310-9d5d99f827a8" label="lyrics-like">Lcátus Apóstolüs, segregátus in</l><l xml:id="m-0f0523c2-7073-4221-a061-80cacb372bba" facs="#m-c41dbf80-c53a-4ddb-b122-4e7996d50bda" label="lyrics-like">factus est ei ex sémine David se¬</l><l xml:id="m-2e7e7c91-8a70-43df-9adb-dc1a69479bd1" facs="#m-aa665c15-b0f3-42c8-9de9-df51230b02f6" label="lyrics-like">Evangélium Dei, t quod ante pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-3eafa06b-39c2-43c3-b6c6-dd7a582618d1" facs="#m-4873f2be-32cf-48fe-b438-b987ff112f62" label="lyrics-like">cúndum carnem.</l><l xml:id="m-bc436992-b8dd-418d-b59e-cf4e4c02f3fc" facs="#m-db5c0654-d4a3-4188-abd8-a9ab680ea38c" label="lyrics-like">míserãt per prophétas suos in Scri¬</l><l xml:id="m-1181a5b9-bcda-4f10-b509-bd93063e7221" facs="#m-0784ccd0-a720-4633-bdd8-abbc3e206374" label="ambiguous">Short!</l><l xml:id="m-bc62ee39-7d70-423b-b6c3-bc40758044f6" facs="#m-084e9936-b5f4-4cdb-95c5-7e78603900b1" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-4fa63614-5cb7-4282-8bf9-02be18fcf959" facs="#m-b49c0e6f-213c-4d34-9160-b01020def564" label="lyrics-like">AOdi-e sci-é-tis" Qui-a véni- et Dóminus. Hódi-e.</l><l xml:id="m-a2be63ea-04c2-4551-b10c-bff9689ce156" facs="#m-b84b3b5a-9901-4811-9aeb-35ca4b4a335b" label="lyrics-like">V. Et mane vidébi-tis gló-ri-am é-jus. "Qui-a. Gló-ri-a</l><l xml:id="m-16fc052f-f081-4610-8477-f31da9b34f7a" facs="#m-8e4400d7-6897-476a-a7fc-bcc89da21fe3" label="lyrics-like">Pátri, et Fi-li-o, et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto. Hódi-e.</l><l xml:id="m-12947909-602e-4d4f-a5df-09adafb8f5b6" facs="#m-3334d1ba-8e42-4293-8999-6996325ce4e6" label="lyrics-like">V. Constántes estóte.</l><l xml:id="m-0966a6d5-0bcd-4d52-86a0-be32dc63e909" facs="#m-425a6441-789d-4e97-b2d9-0c17237f8e54" label="lyrics-like">R. Vidébitis auxilium Dómini super vos.</l><l xml:id="m-804f8c2b-fd75-4426-9ad7-3dfe7a177250" facs="#m-bff95180-913a-46f4-a25c-1e8ad8ecddf6" label="text-like">TIf Christmas Eve falls on a Sunday, Mass is celebrated after Terce; on</l><l xml:id="m-c11fd61a-ca66-4bc2-b47d-0b36499486a1" facs="#m-281ae484-74bf-4319-a3da-95f142506719" label="text-like">other days, after None.</l><l xml:id="m-882f7c03-caa3-4919-a5a4-139e5e2e88b5" facs="#m-8d13fef7-a3be-4847-baf3-68109e91abdd" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-8e8814d8-9aa0-4da5-9e20-4f8c76a16be7" facs="#m-33b8363a-44af-41f6-b667-43ed2873c331" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-912f89be-50b6-4037-9a09-5db0184e688b" facs="#m-fe7ce8ca-db72-43f1-bd2d-26e30796e325" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-28c62879-5b09-47bc-b885-6de9451ac1e1" facs="#m-62849070-1a9d-4e1e-b213-b73564cf3c64" label="lyrics-like">O- di-e sci- é¬ tis, qui-a vé-ni-et Dóminus,</l><l xml:id="m-2775b0f9-215b-43af-94a6-f1405f2f94c3" facs="#m-a876439c-1778-4baf-9258-9318b1b4c9b1" label="lyrics-like">vidé-bi¬</l><l xml:id="m-f8f4d0e6-fadd-4ea3-beb2-0e09fbf86119" facs="#m-334d585b-e78e-44d1-9dc8-9bf37c99c9fd" label="lyrics-like">tis gló-ri-am</l><l xml:id="m-22a9a6ab-d97d-4a5d-909f-e0d58c1eca75" facs="#m-64c97e6d-f769-4689-b51f-64964da06b5c" label="lyrics-like">et salvá-bit nos: et ma-ne</l><l xml:id="m-93cf97d1-5dc8-4cef-a1e0-2fc4cc3da79d" facs="#m-ce681a8d-a532-4ac4-94d3-bf2a564173e7" label="lyrics-like">órbis</l><l xml:id="m-3a47fa2d-d7f4-4381-9cdb-b768a3d1caed" facs="#m-e9fc651b-0fe9-487e-97ff-f2d080cf6000" label="lyrics-like">éjus. Ps. Dómi-ni est térra, et pleni-túdo éjus:</l></lg>
